[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2785350057","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104954#issuecomment-2785350057","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104954","id":2785350057,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6mBRGp","user":{"login":"arkology","id":43543909,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQzNTQzOTA5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/43543909?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkology","html_url":"https://github.com/arkology","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkology/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkology/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkology/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkology/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkology/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkology/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkology/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkology/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkology/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-08T06:20:11Z","updated_at":"2025-04-08T06:20:11Z","body":"Side note: Adding more content to top bar will make https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/102359 even more noticeable (for \"default\" editor without any addons). But it should not be a blocker for current PR.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2785350057/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2816543208","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104954#issuecomment-2816543208","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104954","id":2816543208,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6n4Qno","user":{"login":"Meorge","id":9957987,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk5NTc5ODc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9957987?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge","html_url":"https://github.com/Meorge","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-19T05:14:41Z","updated_at":"2025-04-19T05:14:41Z","body":"At long last I've been able to return to this project!\r\n\r\nFor now I think I'm going to reduce the scope of it a bit, and remove these goals I originally had listed:\r\n- Right-align the text in the `LineEdit`, so the user can see the name of the file rather than the start of the path(?)\r\n- Include other Movie Maker settings(?)\r\n\r\nMaking a modification to the `LineEdit` seems like it'd fit as its own PR, and I'm not sure exactly what other Movie Maker settings should be included in the dropdown.\r\nI may also remove the \"current scene movie path\" goal and save that for the future as well.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2816543208/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2820130231","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104954#issuecomment-2820130231","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104954","id":2820130231,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6oF8W3","user":{"login":"Meorge","id":9957987,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk5NTc5ODc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9957987?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge","html_url":"https://github.com/Meorge","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-22T05:41:09Z","updated_at":"2025-04-22T05:41:09Z","body":"I'll admit I'm not especially thrilled with the current state of this feature, but I'm going to mark it as ready for review now, so I can get more feedback on it.\r\n\r\nI'm going to remove the goal of having a checkbox to switch between setting the global movie path and the scene-local movie path. Based on my understanding of how the scene-local movie path works, changing it in this menu from scene-local to global would be destructive - we'd have to delete the `movie_file` root node metadata. (While we could perhaps rename `movie_file` to something else, like `movie_file_inactive`, that feels very hacky to me, and could in theory conflict with other settings.)\r\n\r\nI have, however, added a button that takes you straight to the Movie Writer section of the Project Settings, which is nice.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2820130231/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2820459068","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104954#issuecomment-2820459068","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104954","id":2820459068,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6oHMo8","user":{"login":"KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi","html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-22T07:45:58Z","updated_at":"2025-04-22T07:45:58Z","body":"It would be better if it didn't introduce a new button IMO.\r\nYou could change the original Movie Maker button to open a popup instead of toggling, with one of the options being a checkbox for enabling the mode. Though you'll need to ensure that the state is still visible without opening the menu.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2820459068/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2821582585","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104954#issuecomment-2821582585","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104954","id":2821582585,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6oLe75","user":{"login":"Meorge","id":9957987,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk5NTc5ODc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9957987?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge","html_url":"https://github.com/Meorge","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-22T14:47:22Z","updated_at":"2025-04-22T14:47:22Z","body":"I agree about the new button. Space in the top bar is important, and having one \"whole\" button that simply acts to augment the behavior of another \"whole\" button feels off as a result.\r\nIf it could be added as a \"side button\" to the Movie Maker button with a smaller width, such that pressing the main button would toggle the mode and the side button would open options, I think that'd be at least *better*.\r\nThat may risk having users believe the side button is related to all of the run bar, though, and not just the Movie Maker button.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2821582585/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2918327610","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104954#issuecomment-2918327610","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104954","id":2918327610,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6t8iU6","user":{"login":"Meorge","id":9957987,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk5NTc5ODc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9957987?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge","html_url":"https://github.com/Meorge","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-29T05:22:38Z","updated_at":"2025-05-29T05:22:38Z","body":"Closing for now, as a simpler-but-similarly-powerful version was implemented with #106231 ","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2918327610/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app"